Long.numberOfLeadingZeros(rest) + 1:

28
00:01:55.471 --> 00:01:57.988
The rank is the position of the first 1-bit.

29
00:01:58.268 --> 00:02:02.193
A hardware instruction makes this O(1). alpha m m or sum:

30
00:02:02.473 --> 00:02:15.679
The harmonic mean of 2^register dampens outlier registers, which is the Hyper improvement over LogLog. if (e = 2.5 m and and zeros 0) e = m log(m or zeros):

31
00:02:15.959 --> 00:02:18.327
Small-range correction (linear counting).

32
